{"meta":{"id":"value-html","category":"it/syntax/jquery/dom","title":"값 · html 읽고 쓰기 · jQuery","subtitle":"(JQUERY · AJAX)","summary":"val, focus, html vs text, empty · remove, load 로 부분 새로고침","tags":["jquery","f-dom","f-form"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JQUERY · AJAX</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">값 · html 읽고 쓰기 · jQuery</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> val, focus, html vs text, empty · remove, load 로 부분 새로고침</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">값 · 내용</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">$(&quot;#product&quot;).val();             // input 값 읽기\r\n$(&quot;#product&quot;).val(&quot;새 값&quot;);       // 값 쓰기\r\n$(&quot;#mid&quot;).focus();               // 커서 이동\r\n$(&quot;#demo&quot;).html(&quot;&lt;b&gt;출력값&lt;/b&gt;&quot;); // innerHTML\r\n$(&quot;#demo&quot;).text(&quot;글자 그대로&quot;);   // textContent\r\n$(&quot;#demo&quot;).empty();              // 안의 내용 삭제\r\n$(&quot;.item&quot;).remove();             // 요소 자체 삭제\r\n$(&quot;#list&quot;).load(location.href + &quot; #list&quot;);   // 현재 페이지에서 #list 부분만 다시 불러오기</pre></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-cyan-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모의 $(#아이디) 는 따옴표가 빠져 있다 — $(\"#아이디\") 로 문자열을 넣어야 한다. load 는 주소와 선택자 사이에 공백이 필요.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JavaScript › HTML 값 읽기 · DOM</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jquery/dom/value-html","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jquery","title":"JQUERY · AJAX","path":"it/syntax/jquery"},{"id":"dom","title":"DOM 조작","path":"it/syntax/jquery/dom"}],"hasImage":false}